From 815e58104b683681778669a0373589d2664473b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Corvid <corvid@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:41:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Fork: a channel can read another channel's source or program
 (v1.9.2)

The input stream list of RTMP/SRT push sources now names the streams of the
other channels (their source and their program on the RTMP server) also while
nobody sends them, instead of only the raw names of streams sent right now.

